1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,462
Two coffees.

2
00:00:01,462 --> 00:00:03,380
I was eating alone.

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,494
The waitress smiled.

4
00:00:05,494 --> 00:00:06,781
"For your friend.

5
00:00:06,781 --> 00:00:08,220
Black, two sugars."

6
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,460
That's how my father drank it.

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,320
He died in March.

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,385
I asked her...

9
00:00:14,385 --> 00:00:15,640
what friend?

10
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,727
"The tall man in the green jacket.

11
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:20,410
He walked in with you."

12
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:22,780
We buried Dad in that jacket.

13
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,880
I looked down at my plate.

14
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,960
When I looked up, his cup was half empty.

15
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,857
I went to pay.

16
00:00:29,857 --> 00:00:31,710
It was already paid.

17
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,410
And on the tip line, in his handwriting...

18
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,040
"Proud of you, kid."

19
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:39,660
Now every time I stop at
that diner, I order...
